      {
        "id": "cf_note",
        "type": "flograph.util.note",
        "pos": [
          0,
          400
        ],
        "params": {
          "text": "## Click a table to filter\n\n**Pick here** has *On click ▸ select many*. Click it and everything wired\nto its **filtered** output follows — the total, the chart and the rows.\n\n- **Click a cell** — keep the rows with that value (`North`).\n- **Ctrl+click more cells** — values in one column add up (North *or*\n  South); columns narrow each other (North *and* Widget).\n- **Click a row number** — keep that row.\n- **Ctrl+click a column header** — keep only that column. A plain click\n  still sorts.\n- **Click the pick again**, press **Esc**, or right-click ▸ **Clear\n  Selection** to let every row back.\n\nWhat you picked shows in **Selected** in the properties panel. **table**\nstays whole, so the card always has every row to pick from.\n\nThe **matrix** below is *select one*: click a region's row and only that\nrow of the matrix goes on.\n",
          "width": 460,
          "height": 0
        },
        "code": null,
        "label": null
      },
